85d5a001a43b01d0ecc2ee084af","body":[{"type":"text","value":"10. 如图为一双向潮汐能发电站的截面图，涨、退潮时海水均能带动涡轮发电机组发电。若某次涨、退潮时间均为 "},{"type":"math","value":"t"},{"type":"text","value":" ，涨、退潮时流过涡轮发电机组的海水体积均为 "},{"type":"math","value":"V"},{"type":"text","value":" ，海水密度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\rho"},{"type":"text","value":" ，流过涡轮发电机组的速率视为恒定。涡轮发电机上安装多个半径为 "},{"type":"math","value":"r"},{"type":"text","value":" 的叶片，将海水的动能转化为电能的效率为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\eta"},{"type":"text","value":" ，涡轮发电机转轴体积及涡轮发电机与通道间空隙\n不计。产生的电能全供给“储充一体”的充电站，充电站内部电路等效电阻的阻值为 "},{"type":"math","value":"R"},{"type":"text","value":" 。则在此次涨潮和退潮的时间内\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/77d216066ec9800f8b17243a5adb31cfedabc91e6e3d41d2c83146de05c44f9a.png","width":467,"height":278,"width_mm":54.772,"row_group":"qulihu-sandishi-2611-q10-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第10题图\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 经过涡轮发电机组的海水流量为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{V}{2t}"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 涡轮发电机组的发电功率为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{\\rho\\eta V^3}{2\\pi^2 t^3 r^4}"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 充电站充电电流为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{V}{\\pi tr^2} \\sqrt{\\frac{\\rho\\eta V}{Rt}}"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 产生的电能可将 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{\\rho\\eta V^3}{2E\\pi^2 t^2 r^4}"},{"type":"text","value":" 台电能已耗尽且最大储能为 "},{"type":"math","value":"E"},{"type":"text","value":" 的汽车充满电"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"B","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-27-shoukao--qulihu-sandishi-2611-q11","paper_id":"zj-27-shoukao--qulihu-sandishi-2611","source_question_id":"qulihu-sandishi-2611-q11","number":"11","order":11,"type":"多选题","topics":["力学","电学","近代物理"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"fc63d59a247d5a2dcccb84b69e636ab951f48caa46b837e9cecd1d882826fd79","body":[{"type":"text","value":"11. 关于下列四幅图的描述，正确的是\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/db84e53aea44d4a3892e2dfe277cf40be61f930954605aad863830ea16df79b9.png","width":280,"height":231,"width_mm":32.752,"row_group":"qulihu-sandishi-2611-q11-row1"},{"