xt","value":"（1分）\n（4）粒子在玻璃管中做螺旋运动，周期为"},{"type":"math","value":"T = \\frac{2\\pi m}{eB}"},{"type":"text","value":"一个周期内运动的水平距离为"},{"type":"math","value":"x_{1}=0.5v_{0}T=\\frac{\\pi mv_{0}}{eB},\\quad x_{2}=0.8v_{0}T=\\frac{1.6\\pi mv_{0}}{eB}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n故"},{"type":"math","value":"z"},{"type":"text","value":"轴有粒子的区间为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{\\pi mv_0}{eB} \\leq z \\leq \\frac{1.6\\pi mv_0}{eB}"},{"type":"text","value":"第2个周期内运动的水平距离为"},{"type":"math","value":"x_{3} = \\frac{2\\pi mv_{0}}{eB}, x_{4} = \\frac{3.2\\pi mv_{0}}{eB}"},{"type":"text","value":"第3个周期运动的水平距离为"},{"type":"math","value":"x_{5} = \\frac{3\\pi mv_{0}}{eB}, x_{6} = \\frac{4.8\\pi mv_{0}}{eB}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分)\n第 2 与第 3 周期开始重叠，之后也重叠，故 z 轴有粒子的区间为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac {2 \\pi m v _ {0}}{e B} <   z <   \\frac {2 0 0 \\pi m v _ {0}}{e B}"},{"type":"text","value":"综上所述，z轴出现粒子的区间为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac {\\pi m v _ {0}}{e B} \\leq z \\leq \\frac {1 . 6 \\pi m v _ {0}}{e B} \\text {和} \\frac {2 \\pi m v _ {0}}{e B} <   z <   \\frac {2 0 0 \\pi m v _ {0}}{e B} (1 \\text {分})"}]}}]}
